// 3. Update SPREADSHEET_ID to match your Google Sheet (should be same as contact form)
// 4. Update MANAGEMENT_EMAIL if needed (currently set to mgmt.rcs@gmail.com)
// 5. Run testSpreadsheetAccess() to verify connection to your existing Sheet1
// 6. Run testQualificationForm() to test the simplified data saving
// 7. Run initializeQualificationSystem() once to set up the system
// 8. Deploy as web app:
//    - Click "Deploy" > "New Deployment"
//    - Choose "Web app" as type
//    - Set execute as "Me" and access to "Anyone"
//    - Copy the web app URL
// 9. Replace the URL in qualification.html with your web app URL
//
// NOTE: This saves only essential contact data to Sheet1:
// - Timestamp, First Name, Last Name, Phone, Email, Company Name, Business Email
// - All other fields (address, city, state, country, zip, business description, employees, services) are left BLANK
// - Questionnaire details are only included in emails, not the spreadsheet